            "review_title": "Review at High47 Craft beer station Dak Lak",
            "review_text": "Hoàng L\n1 contribution\n1\nExcellent craft beer in the heart of Buon Ma Thuot\nSep 2025 • Friends\nA wonderful experience at High47 Craft Beer Station! \n\nThe staff here are lovely, professional, and always cheerful, making every guest feel at ease. The craft beer is excellent: tasty, diverse in flavors and a memorable treat for anyone who loves authentic brews.\n\nThe space is beautiful, modern yet cozy, perfect for hanging out with friends or enjoying a date. It’s right in the heart of Buon Ma Thuot, yet located on a peaceful street, close enough for convenience, far enough for relaxation.\n\nWhat’s even better is that guests can freely order food from outside and bring it in, with no extra charge, a thoughtful touch that makes the experience even more comfortable and flexible.\n\nA must-visit spot to sip a cold craft beer and fully enjoy the unique vibe of Vietnam’s coffee capital!\nRead more\nWritten September 25, 2025",
